 "kind": "answer",
 "message": "You can reset your password or MFA yourself at reset.fernhollow.test using your registered phone; the helpdesk can't reset it over chat. Passwords and multi-factor authentication (POL-PWD-01): The helpdesk never resets passwords or MFA over chat, for anyone. Employees reset their own password and MFA at the self-service portal, reset.fernhollow.test, using their registered phone. An employee who cannot use self-service (lost phone, locked out of the portal) is escalated to IT, who verify identity on a video call before resetting anything. Nobody may ask the helpdesk to reset another person's password.",
 "cited_policy_ids": [
  "POL-PWD-01"
 ]
}
